ce gelişmiş Mini LED teknolojisiyle, en yüksek ekran kalitesini bütçenizi zorlamadan sunar. QHD çözünürlük (2560x1440), 180 Hz&#x27;lik yüksek yenileme hızı ve ışık hızındaki 1 ms GtG tepki süresiyle olağanüstü bir oyun deneyimi sizi bekliyor. Çarpıcı kontrastı ve canlı renkleriyle HDR1000 sertifikalı bu monitörle aksiyona dalın."/><link rel="manifest" href="/manifest.webmanifest"/><meta name="robots" content="index, follow"/><meta name="msapplication-TileColor" content="#ffffff"/><meta name="theme-color" content="#ffffff"/><link rel="canonical" href="https://www.aoc.com/tr/gaming/monitors/q27g3xmn_bk"/><link rel="alternate" hrefLang="tr-tr" href="https://www.aoc.com/tr/gaming/monitors/q27g3xmn_bk"/><link rel="alternate" hrefLang="en-hu" href="https://www.aoc.com/hu/gaming/monitors/q27g3xmn_bk"/><link rel="alternate" hrefLang="en-kg" href="https://www.aoc.com/kg/gaming/monitors/q27g3xmn_bk"/><link rel="alternate" hrefLang="ru-tm" href="https://www.aoc.com/tm/gaming/monitors/q27g3xmn_bk"/><link rel="alternate" hrefLang="et-ee" href="https://www.aoc.com/ee/gaming/monitors/q27g3xmn_bk"/><link rel="alternate" hrefLang="fr-fr" href="https://www.aoc.com/fr/gaming/monitors/q27g3xmn_bk"/><link rel="alternate" hrefLang="en-gr" href="https://www.aoc.com/gr/gaming/monitors/q27g3xmn_bk"/><link rel="alternate" hrefLang="en-lt" href="https://www.aoc.com/lt/gaming/monitors/q27g3xmn_bk"/><link rel="alternate" hrefLang="en-mk" href="https://www.aoc.com/mk/gaming/monitors/q27g3xmn_bk"/><link rel="alternate" hrefLang="de-ch" href="https://www.aoc.com/ch/gaming/monitors/q27g3xmn_bk"/><link rel="alternate" hrefLang="fi-fi" href="https://www.aoc.com/fi/gaming/monitors/q27g3xmn_bk"/><link rel="alternate" hrefLang="fr-be" href="https://www.aoc.com/be-fr/gaming/monitors/q27g3xmn_bk"/><link rel="alternate" hrefLang="cs-cz" href="https://www.aoc.com/cz/gaming/monitors/q27g3xmn_bk"/><link rel="alternate" hrefLang="de-de" href="https://www.aoc.com/de/gaming/monitors/q27g3xmn_bk"/><link rel="alt