ss="toolbar__menu-item"><a class="toolbar__menu-link" rel="noreferrer" target="_self" href="#compactFeatureHighlighter">Özellikler</a></li><li class="toolbar__menu-item"><a class="toolbar__menu-link" rel="noreferrer" target="_self" href="#productSpecifications">Teknik özellikler</a></li><li class="toolbar__menu-item"><a class="toolbar__menu-link" rel="noreferrer" target="_self" href="#driversAndManuals">Sürücüler ve kılavuzlar</a></li></ul></nav></div></div></div></div></section><section id="block-poy9wz92t8-2" class="content-blocks__entry" aria-label="GÜCÜNÜZÜ AÇIĞA ÇIKARIN"><div class="product-slogan orange-theme"><div class="product-slogan__wrapper"><div class="product-slogan__body"><div class="product-slogan__header"><h2 class="heading heading--h2">GÜCÜNÜZÜ AÇIĞA ÇIKARIN</h2></div><div class="product-slogan__aside"><p class="product-slogan__content">Q27G3XMN/BK Mini LED oyun monitörüyle oyun deneyimini zirvede yaşayın. Fast VA paneli ve 336 bölgeli son derece gelişmiş Mini LED teknolojisiyle, en yüksek ekran kalitesini bütçenizi zorlamadan sunar. QHD çözünürlük (2560x1440), 180 Hz&#x27;lik yüksek yenileme hızı ve ışık hızındaki 1 ms GtG tepki süresiyle olağanüstü bir oyun deneyimi sizi bekliyor. Çarpıcı kontrastı ve canlı renkleriyle HDR1000 sertifikalı bu monitörle aksiyona dalın.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section id="block-poy9wz92t8-3" class="content-blocks__entry"><section><div class="specification-highlight orange-theme"><div class="specification-highlight__body" style="background-image:url(/theme/assets/images/galaxy-gaming.webp)"><div class="specification-highlight__content"><div class="specification-highlight__list"><ul class="specification-highlight__items"><li class="specification-highlight__item"><div class="highlight-card"><span class="heading heading--subheader">Ekran boyu (inç)</span><h3 class="heading heading--h4">27.0</h3><div class="highlight-card__cover"><img alt="27 inch" class="highlight-card__image" src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/hf5b3axp/production/9fa31a9b756a654f867b773553309edb843522ea-313x241.png?w=1920&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format"/></div></div></li><li class="specification-highlight__item"><div class="highlight-card"><span class="heading heading--subheader">Panel çözünürlüğü</span><h3 class="heading heading--h4">2560x1440</h3><div class="highlight-card__cover"><img alt="2560x1440" class="highlight-card__image" src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/hf5b3axp/production/e33fbe58dd232f5f4160a2fbd2429dbef06c7e7c-313x242.png?w=1920&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format"/></div></div></li><li class="specification-highlight__item"><div class="highlight-card"><span class="heading heading--subheader">Panel tipi</span><h3 class="heading heading--h4">Fast VA</h3><div class="highlight-card__cover"><img alt="fast VA panel" class="highlight-card__image" src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/hf5b3axp/production/aa0064d72b8e5a668901ff264f24290a3d09e400-313x242.png?w=1920&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format"/></div></div></li><li class="specification-highlight__item"><div class="highlight-card"><span class="heading heading--subheader">Yanıt süresi GtG</span><h3 class="heading heading--h4">1 ms</h3><div class="highlight-card__cover"><img alt="1 ms response time" class="highlight-card__image" src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/hf5b3axp/production/5ddacd08e985f4cd9ae3d51f76c1aa8140026198-312x242.png?w=1920&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format"/></div></div></li><li class="specification-highlight__item"><div class="highlight-card"><span class="heading heading--subheader">Senkronizasyon teknolojisi (VRR)</span><h3 class="heading heading--h4">Adaptive Sync</h3><div class="highlight-card__cover"><img alt="adaptive sync" class="highlight-card__image" src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/hf5b3axp/production/c3abfd488c180fbe3f44dd9777e02bfa9dcbbaaa-312x241.png?w=1920&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format"/></div></div></li><li class="specification-highlight__item"><div class="highlight-card highlight-card--is-secondary highlight-card--is-orange"><h3 class="heading heading--h4">Bu ürünün sunduğu tüm avantajları keşfedin</h3><a class="button button--is-secondary button--is-link" rel="noreferrer" target="_self" href="#productSpecifications"><span class="button__label">Tüm teknik özellikleri görüntüle</span><svg class="focus-indicator" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" height="50%"><defs><linearGradient id="gradient" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="0%"><stop offset="0%" style="stop-color:var(--gradient-start-indicator)"></stop><stop offset="100%" style="stop-color:var(--gradient-end-indicator)"></stop></linearGradient></defs><rect x="5%" y="5%" width="90%" height="90%" fill="none" stroke="url(#gradient)" stroke-width="var(--stroke-width-indicator)" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-dashoffset="var(--stroke-dash-offset-indicator)" stroke-linecap="butt" stroke-dasharray="var(--stroke-dash-array-indicator)" rx="2" ry="2"></rect></svg></a></div></li></ul></div></div><div class="specification-highlight__indicator"><span class="specification-highlight__indicator-element" style="opacity:0"></span></div></div><footer class="specification-highlight__footer"><a class="link link--is-secondary" rel="noreferrer" target="_self" href="#productSpecifications">Tüm teknik özellikleri görüntüle<svg class="focus-indicator" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" height="50%"><defs><linearGradient id="gradient" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="0%"><stop offset="0%" style="stop-color:var(--gradient-start-indicator)"></stop><stop offset="100%" style="stop-color:var(--gradient-end-indicator)"></stop></linearGradient></defs><rect x="5%" y="5%" width="90%" height="90%" fill="none" stroke="url(#gradient)" stroke-width="var(--stroke-width-indicator)" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-dashoffset="var(--stroke-dash-offset-indicator)" stroke-linecap="butt" stroke-dasharray="var(--stroke-dash-array-indicator)" rx="2" ry="2"></rect></svg></a></footer></div></section></section><section id="block-poy9wz92t8-4" class="content-blocks__entry" aria-label="Önemli özellikler"><section class="feature-highlighter orange-theme" id="compactFeatureHighlighter"><div class="feature-highlighter__sections"><section class="feature-highlighter__section feature-highlighter__section--has-image feature-highlighter__section--is-expanded"><div class="feature-highlighter__section-wrapper" id="-0"><header class="feature-highlighter__section-header"><button class="feature-highlighter__section-toggle feature-highlighter__section-toggle--is-selected">VA paneli<span class="icon icon--chevronDown"><svg width="14" height="9" viewBox="0 0 14 9" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path clip-rule="evenodd" d="M7 8.13876L13.0178 1.82988L11.976 0.836057L7 6.05267L2.02403 0.836057L0.982147 1.82988L7 8.13876Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></span></button></header><div class="feature-highlighter__section-body"><div class="feature-highlighter__section-poster"><figure class="feature-highlighter__section-figure"><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/hf5b3axp/production/0521ce955b9742413e991b248b6e4ff7283ac4e0-1920x1920.png?w=800&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format" srcSet="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/hf5b3axp/production/0521ce955b9742413e991b248b6e4ff7283ac4e0-1920x1920.png?w=320&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 320w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/hf5b3axp/production/0521ce955b9742413e991b248b6e4ff7283ac4e0-1920x1920.png?w=400&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 400w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/hf5b3axp/production/0521ce955b9742413e991b248b6e4ff7283ac4e0-1920x1920.png?w=640&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 640w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/hf5b3axp/production/0521ce955b9742413e991b248b6e4ff7283ac4e0-1920x1920.png?w=1200&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 1200w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/hf5b3axp/production/0521ce955b9742413e991b248b6e4ff7283ac4e0-1920x1920.png?w=2000&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 2000w" sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px" alt="VA paneli" loading="lazy" class="feature-highlighter__section-image" height="auto" width="auto"/></figure></div><div class="feature-highlighter__section-content"><h3 class="heading heading--h3">VA paneli</h3><section class="formatted">VA (Vertical Alignment) paneli, daha canlı ve parlak görüntüler için daha koyu siyahlar ve yüksek kontrast sunar.</section></div></div></div></section><section class="feature-highlighter__section feature-highlighter__section--has-image"><div class="feature-highlighter__section-wrapper" id="-1"><header class="feature-highlighter__section-header"><button class="feature-highlighter__section-toggle">GMENU<span class="icon icon--chevronDown"><svg width="14" height="9" viewBox="0 0 14 9" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path clip-rule="evenodd" d="M7 8.13876L13.0178 1.82988L11.976 0.836057L7 6.05267L2.02403 0.836057L0.982147 1.82988L7 8.13876Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></span></button></header><div class="feature-highlighter__section-body"><div class="feature-highlighter__section-poster feature-highlighter__section-poster--is-wide"><figure class="feature-highlighter__section-figure"><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/hf5b3axp/production/a11182f36a193eaa8c2bf95c60a7e10054a6b11a-3840x1500.png?w=800&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format" srcSet="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/hf5b3axp/production/a11182f36a193eaa8c2bf95c60a7e10054a6b11a-3840x1500.png?w=320&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 320w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/hf5b3axp/production/a11182f36a193eaa8c2bf95c60a7e10054a6b11a-3840x1500.png?w=400&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 400w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/hf5b3axp/production/a11182f36a193eaa8c2bf95c60a7e10054a6b11a-3840x1500.png?w=640&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 640w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/hf5b3axp/production/a11182f36a193eaa8c2bf95c60a7e10054a6b11a-3840x1500.png?w=1200&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 1200w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/hf5b3axp/production/a11182f36a193eaa8c2bf95c60a7e10054a6b11a-3840x1500.png?w=2400&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 2400w" sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px" alt="GMENU" loading="lazy" class="feature-highlighter__section-image" height="auto" width="auto"/></figure></div><div class="feature-highlighter__section-content"><h3 class="heading heading--h3">GMENU</h3><section class="formatted">AOC G-Menu, eksiksiz özelleştirmeyi maksimum rahatlıkla eşleştirmek için PC&#x27;nize yükleyebileceğiniz ücretsiz bir araçtır.</section></div></div></div></section><section class="feature-highlighter__section feature-highlighter__section--has-image"><div class="feature-highlighter__section-wrapper" id="-2"><header class="feature-highlighter__section-header"><button class="feature-highlighter__section-toggle">Yüksekliği Ayarlanabilir Altlık<span class="icon icon--chevronDown"><svg width="14" height="9" viewBox="0 0 14 9" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path clip-rule="evenodd" d="M7 8.13876L13.0178 1.82988L11.976 0.836057L7 6.05267L2.02403 0.836057L0.982147 1.82988L7 8.13876Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></span></button></header><div class="feature-highlighter__section-body"><div class="feature-highlighter__section-poster"><figure class="feature-highlighter__section-figure"><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/hf5b3axp/production/5b8f04ecceaf18fa5405ed99ac65bbabc72d9738-1500x1500.jpg?w=800&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format" srcSet="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/hf5b3axp/production/5b8f04ecceaf18fa5405ed99ac65bbabc72d9738-1500x1500.jpg?w=320&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 320w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/hf5b3axp/production/5b8f04ecceaf18fa5405ed99ac65bbabc72d9738-1500x1500.jpg?w=400&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 400w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/hf5b3axp/production/5b8f04ecceaf18fa5405ed99ac65bbabc72d9738-1500x1500.jpg?w=640&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 640w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/hf5b3axp/production/5b8f04ecceaf18fa5405ed99ac65bbabc72d9738-1500x1500.jpg?w=1200&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 1200w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/hf5b3axp/production/5b8f04ecceaf18fa5405ed99ac65bbabc72d9738-1500x1500.jpg?w=1600&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 1600w" sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px" alt="Yüksekliği Ayarlanabilir Altlık" loading="lazy" class="feature-highlighter__section-image" height="auto" width="auto"/></figure></div><div class="feature-highlighter__section-content"><h3 class="heading heading--h3">Yüksekliği Ayarlanabilir Altlık</h3><section class="formatted">Sizin sağlığınızı önemsiyoruz. Bu monitörün çalışırken, video oynatırken veya izlerken mükemmel oturma pozisyonunuzu bulmanıza yardımcı olan yükseklik ayarlama seçeneklerini sunma nedeni budur. AOC monitörünüzü ihtiyaçlarınıza göre uyarlamak, yalnızca yorgunluğu azaltmanıza ve vücudunuzu sağlıklı tutmanıza yardımcı olmaz. Sonunda, sizin ve ekibinizin, yaptığınız iş ne olursa olsun, daha iyi sonuçlar elde etmesini sağlar.</section></div></div></div></section><section class="feature-highlighter__section feature-highlighter__section--has-image"><div class="feature-highlighter__section-wrapper" id="-3"><header class="feature-highlighter__section-header"><button class="feature-highlighter__section-toggle">QHD çözünürlük<span class="icon icon--chevronDown"><svg width="14" height="9" viewBox="0 0 14 9" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path clip-rule="evenodd" d="M7 8.13876L13.0178 1.82988L11.976 0.836057L7 6.05267L2.02403 0.836057L0.982147 1.82988L7 8.13876Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></span></button></header><div class="feature-highlighter__section-body"><div class="feature-highlighter__section-poster feature-highlighter__section-poster--is-wide"><figure class="feature-highlighter__section-figure"><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/hf5b3axp/production/18b2e6bb3d0ad4857377983ec55da9c7db43cf64-3840x1500.jpg?w=800&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format" srcSet="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/hf5b3axp/production/18b2e6bb3d0ad4857377983ec55da9c7db43cf64-3840x1500.jpg?w=320&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 320w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/hf5b3axp/production/18b2e6bb3d0ad4857377983ec55da9c7db43cf64-3840x1500.jpg?w=400&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 400w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/hf5b3axp/production/18b2e6bb3d0ad4857377983ec55da9c7db43cf64-3840x1500.jpg?w=640&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 640w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/hf5b3axp/production/18b2e6bb3d0ad4857377983ec55da9c7db43cf64-3840x1500.jpg?w=1200&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 1200w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/hf5b3axp/production/18b2e6bb3d0ad4857377983ec55da9c7db43cf64-3840x1500.jpg?w=2400&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 2400w" sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px" alt="QHD çözünürlük" loading="lazy" class="feature-highlighter__section-image" height="auto" width="auto"/></figure></div><div class="feature-highlighter__section-content"><h3 class="heading heading--h3">QHD çözünürlük</h3><section class="formatted">2560 x 1440 çözünürlüklü Quad HD (QHD), en küçük ayrıntıları ortaya çıkaran üstün görüntü kalitesi ve kesin görüntüleme özelliği sunar. 16:9&#x27;luk geniş ekran en boy oranı geniş alanda çalışmak için yeterli alan sunmanın yanı sıra, oyunları veya filmleri orijinal boyutunda görüntülemenizi sağlar.</section></div></div></div></section><section class="feature-highlighter__section feature-highlighter__section--has-image"><div class="feature-highlighter__section-wrapper" id="-4"><header class="feature-highlighter__section-header"><button class="feature-highlighter__section-toggle">180Hz Refresh Rate<span class="icon icon--chevronDown"><svg width="14" height="9" viewBox="0 0 14 9" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path clip-rule="evenodd" d="M7 8.13876L13.0178 1.82988L11.976 0.836057L7 6.05267L2.02403 0.836057L0.982147 1.82988L7 8.13876Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></span></button></header><div class="feature-highlighter__section-body"><div class="feature-highlighter__section-poster"><figure class="feature-highlighter__section-figure"><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/hf5b3axp/production/30023eead90f0aff5c15c019e2680171e1f3b9b3-1500x1500.jpg?w=800&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format" srcSet="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/hf5b3axp/production/30023eead90f0aff5c15c019e2680171e1f3b9b3-1500x1500.jpg?w=320&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 320w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/hf5b3axp/production/30023eead90f0aff5c15c019e2680171e1f3b9b3-1500x1500.jpg?w=400&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 400w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/hf5b3axp/production/30023eead90f0aff5c15c019e2680171e1f3b9b3-1500x1500.jpg?w=640&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 640w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/hf5b3axp/production/30023eead90f0aff5c15c019e2680171e1f3b9b3-1500x1500.jpg?w=1200&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 1200w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/hf5b3axp/production/30023eead90f0aff5c15c019e2680171e1f3b9b3-1500x1500.jpg?w=1600&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 1600w" sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px" alt="180Hz Refresh Rate" loading="lazy" class="feature-highlighter__section-image" height="auto" width="auto"/></figure></div><div class="feature-highlighter__section-content"><h3 class="heading heading--h3">180Hz Refresh Rate</h3><section class="formatted">Rekabetçi ve yoğun oyun, gecikmesiz ve akıcı oyun deneyimi sağlamak için en iyi teknolojiyi gerektirir. Bu AGON by AOC monitörü, 180Hz yenileme hızına sahiptir ve bu da onu standart bir ekrandan 3 kat daha hızlı hale getirir. Daha düşük bir kare hızı, düşmanların ekranda bir noktadan diğerine atlıyormuş gibi görünmesine neden olabilir ve bu da onları vurulması çok zor hedefler haline getirir. 180Hz kare hızı, kritik kayıp görüntüleri ekrana geri yükleyerek düşman hareketlerini ultra yumuşak hareketlerle ortaya çıkarır ve daha kolay hedeflemenize olanak tanır. Bu AGON by AOC oyun monitörüyle giriş gecikmesine ve ekran yırtılmasına katlanmak zorunda kalmayacaksınız.</section></div></div></div></section><section class="feature-highlighter__section feature-highlighter__section--has-image"><div class="feature-highlighter__section-wrapper" id="-5"><header class="feature-highlighter__section-header"><button class="feature-highlighter__section-toggle">1ms Yanıt Süresi GTG - Griden Griye<span class="icon icon--chevronDown"><svg width="14" height="9" viewBox="0 0 14 9" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path clip-rule="evenodd" d="M7 8.13876L13.0178 1.82988L11.976 0.836057L7 6.05267L2.02403 0.836057L0.982147 1.82988L7 8.13876Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></span></button></header><div class="feature-highlighter__section-body"><div class="feature-highlighter__section-poster"><figure class="feature-highlighter__section-figure"><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/hf5b3axp/production/cfaec6fef43b02d6c7f79c8bcfe6b31dd21d4dee-1500x1500.jpg?w=800&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format" srcSet="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/hf5b3axp/production/cfaec6fef43b02d6c7f79c8bcfe6b31dd21d4dee-1500x1500.jpg?w=320&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 320w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/hf5b3axp/production/cfaec6fef43b02d6c7f79c8bcfe6b31dd21d4dee-1500x1500.jpg?w=400&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 400w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/hf5b3axp/production/cfaec6fef43b02d6c7f79c8bcfe6b31dd21d4dee-1500x1500.jpg?w=640&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 640w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/hf5b3axp/production/cfaec6fef43b02d6c7f79c8bcfe6b31dd21d4dee-1500x1500.jpg?w=1200&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 1200w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/hf5b3axp/production/cfaec6fef43b02d6c7f79c8bcfe6b31dd21d4dee-1500x1500.jpg?w=1600&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 1600w" sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px" alt="1ms Yanıt Süresi GTG - Griden Griye" loading="lazy" class="feature-highlighter__section-image" height="auto" width="auto"/></figure></div><div class="feature-highlighter__section-content"><h3 class="heading heading--h3">1ms Yanıt Süresi GTG - Griden Griye</h3><section class="formatted">GtG, Griden Griye anlamına gelir ve bir pikselin bir gri seviyeden diğerine geçmesinin ne kadar sürdüğünü temsil eder. Oyunlarda her milisaniye önemlidir ve şutu vurmak ile kaçırmak arasındaki fark olabilir. Hızlı tepki süresi, yırtılmayı ve hareket bulanıklığını da ortadan kaldırır.</section></div></div></div></section><section class="feature-highlighter__section feature-highlighter__section--has-image"><div class="feature-highlighter__section-wrapper" id="-6"><header class="feature-highlighter__section-header"><button class="feature-highlighter__section-toggle">MiniLed<span class="icon icon--chevronDown"><svg width="14" height="9" viewBox="0 0 14 9" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path clip-rule="evenodd" d="M7 8.13876L13.0178 1.82988L11.976 0.836057L7 6.05267L2.02403 0.836057L0.982147 1.82988L7 8.13876Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></span></button></header><div class="feature-highlighter__section-body"><div class="feature-highlighter__section-poster"><figure class="feature-highlighter__section-figure"><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/hf5b3axp/production/6d3a64780dcd15c5030cb0d124d451135378ad84-3840x3840.jpg?w=800&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format" srcSet="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/hf5b3axp/production/6d3a64780dcd15c5030cb0d124d451135378ad84-3840x3840.jpg?w=320&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 320w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/hf5b3axp/production/6d3a64780dcd15c5030cb0d124d451135378ad84-3840x3840.jpg?w=400&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 400w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/hf5b3axp/production/6d3a64780dcd15c5030cb0d124d451135378ad84-3840x3840.jpg?w=640&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 640w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/hf5b3axp/production/6d3a64780dcd15c5030cb0d124d451135378ad84-3840x3840.jpg?w=1200&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 1200w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/hf5b3axp/production/6d3a64780dcd15c5030cb0d124d451135378ad84-3840x3840.jpg?w=2400&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 2400w" sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px" alt="MiniLed" loading="lazy" class="feature-highlighter__section-image" height="auto" width="auto"/></figure></div><div class="feature-highlighter__section-content"><h3 class="heading heading--h3">MiniLed</h3><section class="formatted">Uygulamaya geçirilen Mini-LED teknolojisi sayesinde, bu model en yüksek parlaklığı, en iyi görüntü kalitesini ve en iyi düzgünlüğü birleştirirken konvansiyonel LED’e sahip monitörlerden daha ince olmayı başarıyor. İçine çekme deneyimini azaltan grinin 50 tonu silinerek, gerçek karanlık ve daha küçük haleler sağlanıyor</section></div></div></div></section></div><nav class="feature-highlighter__bookmarker"><ul class="feature-highlighter__bookmarker-items" aria-label="Önemli özellikler"><li class="feature-highlighter__bookmarker-item"><a class="feature-highlighter__bookmarker-toggle feature-highlighter__bookmarker-toggle--is-selected" href="#-0"><span class="icon icon--arrowRight"><svg width="13" height="11" viewBox="0 0 13 11" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path clip-rule="evenodd" d="M1.12239e-07 4.37422L0 5.65809L10.5168 5.65809L6.97659 9.22757L7.88176 10.1291L12.9668 5.06454L7.88176 0L6.97485 0.903254L10.4599 4.37422L1.12239e-07 4.37422Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></span>VA paneli</a></li><li class="feature-highlighter__bookmarker-item"><a class="feature-highlighter__bookmarker-toggle" href="#-1"><span class="icon icon--arrowRight"><svg width="13" height="11" viewBox="0 0 13 11" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path clip-rule="evenodd" d="M1.12239e-07 4.37422L0 5.65809L10.5168 5.65809L6.97659 9.22757L7.88176 10.1291L12.9668 5.06454L7.88176 0L6.97485 0.903254L10.4599 4.37422L1.12239e-07 4.37422Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></span>GMENU</a></li><li class="feature-highlighter__bookmarker-item"><a class="feature-highlighter__bookmarker-toggle" href="#-2"><span class="icon icon--arrowRight"><svg width="13" height="11" viewBox="0 0 13 11" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path clip-rule="evenodd" d="M1.12239e-07 4.37422L0 5.65809L10.5168 5.65809L6.97659 9.22757L7.88176 10.1291L12.9668 5.06454L7.88176 0L6.97485 0.903254L10.4599 4.37422L1.12239e-07 4.37422Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></span>Yüksekliği Ayarlanabilir Altlık</a></li><li class="feature-highlighter__bookmarker-item"><a class="feature-highlighter__bookmarker-toggle" href="#-3"><span class="icon icon--arrowRight"><svg width="13" height="11" viewBox="0 0 13 11" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path clip-rule="evenodd" d="M1.12239e-07 4.37422L0 5.65809L10.5168 5.65809L6.97659 9.22757L7.88176 10.1291L12.9668 5.06454L7.88176 0L6.97485 0.903254L10.4599 4.37422L1.12239e-07 4.37422Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></span>QHD çözünürlük</a></li><li class="feature-highlighter__bookmarker-item"><a class="feature-highlighter__bookmarker-toggle" href="#-4"><span class="icon icon--arrowRight"><svg width="13" height="11" viewBox="0 0 13 11" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path clip-rule="evenodd" d="M1.12239e-07 4.37422L0 5.65809L10.5168 5.65809L6.97659 9.22757L7.88176 10.1291L12.9668 5.06454L7.88176 0L6.97485 0.903254L10.4599 4.37422L1.12239e-07 4.37422Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></span>180Hz Refresh Rate</a></li><li class="feature-highlighter__bookmarker-item"><a class="feature-highlighter__bookmarker-toggle" href="#-5"><span class="icon icon--arrowRight"><svg width="13" height="11" viewBox="0 0 13 11" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path clip-rule="evenodd" d="M1.12239e-07 4.37422L0 5.65809L10.5168 5.65809L6.97659 9.22757L7.88176 10.1291L12.9668 5.06454L7.88176 0L6.97485 0.903254L10.4599 4.37422L1.12239e-07 4.37422Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></span>1ms Yanıt Süresi GTG - Griden Griye</a></li><li class="feature-highlighter__bookmarker-item"><a class="feature-highlighter__bookmarker-toggle" href="#-6"><span class="icon icon--arrowRight"><svg width="13" height="11" viewBox="0 0 13 11" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path clip-rule="evenodd" d="M1.12239e-07 4.37422L0 5.65809L10.5168 5.65809L6.97659 9.22757L7.88176 10.1291L12.9668 5.06454L7.88176 0L6.97485 0.903254L10.4599 4.37422L1.12239e-07 4.37422Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></span>MiniLed</a></li><li class="feature-highlighter__bookmarker-skip"><button class="link link--is-secondary" aria-disabled="false" type="button">Özellikleri atla<svg class="focus-indicator" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" height="50%"><defs><linearGradient id="gradient" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="0%"><stop offset="0%" style="stop-color:var(--gradient-start-indicator)"></stop><stop offset="100%" style="stop-color:var(--gradient-end-indicator)"></stop></linearGradient></defs><rect x="5%" y="5%" width="90%" height="90%" fill="none" stroke="url(#gradient)" stroke-width="var(--stroke-width-indicator)" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-dashoffset="var(--stroke-dash-offset-indicator)" stroke-linecap="butt" stroke-dasharray="var(--stroke-dash-array-indicator)" rx="2" ry="2"></rect></svg></button></li></ul></nav></section></section><section id="block-poy9wz92t8-5" class="content-blocks__entry" aria-label="Teknik özellikler"><div class="product-specifications orange-theme" id="productSpecifications"><div class="product-specifications__wrapper"><div class="product-specifications__title-container"><h2 class="heading heading--display">Teknik özellikler</h2><div class="product-specifications__download-link"><a class="link link--is-secondary" rel="noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank" href="https://aocdlw-prd-printservice-web.azurewebsites.net/api/print/monitor/q27g3xmn_bk?locale=tr">Ürün broşürünü indir (PDF)<svg class="focus-indicator" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" height="50%"><defs><linearGradient id="gradient" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="0%"><stop offset="0%" style="stop-color:var(--gradient-start-indicator)"></stop><stop offset="100%" style="stop-color:var(--gradient-end-indicator)"></stop></linearGradie